## This checkout

**`1.6.5-SNAPSHOT`**: Java **11**, **Jakarta** committed types, **14** services (standard HI B2B), `src/main/resources/HI_*.wsdl`, `hi_override/` xmldsig package.

## Build

- JDK **11**, from repo root: `mvn -B "-Dgpg.skip=true" clean verify` (quote `-D` on PowerShell).
- Default build uses **committed** `src/main/java` — no wsimport.
- Regen (**`-Pregenerate-sources`**): requires licensed **`wsdls/xml/`** locally. See **MAINTAINERS.md**.

## vs hi-b2b-client-java

| | **hi-wsdl-java** | **hi-b2b-client-java** |
|---|---|---|
| Delivers | WSDL on classpath + generated types | Facade clients, TLS, signing |
| Artifact | `hi-wsdl` | `hi-b2b-client` |

Align **`hi-wsdl`** and **`hi-b2b-client`** versions per release line table.

